              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpöghisyechï nyu pipö Israel ECHOTYON ompö osiswo Yoswö löwïr nko ompö osiswo poy löwïr cho kidong lötu Yoswö akinkït kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo kighchï ECHOTYON pipö Israel.",
