        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtïpchï pipö Israel koyo Yosep cho kipunö Misri Syekem ato kyala Yakopo werpö Amor papoto Syekem ompö ropïyeni silpa cho le 100. Kïlïkwï nyoni koro pipö Yosep.",
