              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïma Eleasar wero Aron, kïtïpchï chane nyinte Kipea, kanasyanta Pineas werïnyi nyo kikitö nyinte ompö koro Epraim kamas.",
          "type": "text",
